    "description": "Objective\n\nReps should only see their own Sign-Ups in the Console.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Update Sign-Up Console list views to filter on the logged-in user\n\n* Currently open to everyone for testing and UAT — this change MUST land before go-live\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* A Rep sees only records they own in every Console list view\n\nDependencies\n\n* BUILD-38 (Sign-Up Owner = Brand Ambassador) — build ownership FIRST, or the owner filter returns nothing\n\n* BUILD-01 (sharing model)\n\nGO-LIVE GATE. Add to the deployment checklist so this cannot ship open.\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~2h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 14.",
